        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "4724d711-18fb-5c9c-b43f-cf5379c3a822",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S. Shankar, S.P. Venkatesh, K. T. Kunjumon\n- Works: \"Gentleman\", \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\", \"Punjabi House\", \"Style\"\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer, director, producer\n- Awards: Filmfare Best Director Award, Tamil Nadu State Film Award for Best Director\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, S. Shankar made his directorial debut with the film \"Gentleman\", which was produced by K. T. Kunjumon.\n- In 1993, S. Shankar won the Filmfare Best Director Award and the Tamil Nadu State Film Award for Best Director for \"Gentleman\".\n- In 1993, \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" was a Tamil song featured in the film \"Gentleman\".\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer.\n- Suresh Peters performed the notable song \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\".\n- Suresh Peters and S.P. Venkatesh composed the music for \"Punjabi House\", with Suresh Peters composing the songs in his debut as a film composer and S.P. Venkatesh composing the score.\n- Suresh Peters also had a notable song titled \"Style\" from a film whose title is not provided in this chunk.",
